    "identifier": "fire-release-hellfire-rejection",
    "description": "<p>When you are hit by a creature that you can see, you release a brilliant burst of Fire chakra in a 15-foot sphere centered on a point of the space you are occupying. Creatures of your choice caught in the radius must make a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d8+3 Fire damage on a failed save, or half as much on a successful one.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and increase the damage by 1d8+1. If this jutsu is cast at B-Rank or higher, creatures who fail their saving throw gain 2 ranks of Shaken. If this jutsu is cast at A-Rank or higher you can increase the range of this jutsu to Self (30-foot Radius).</p>",
